# One /* block, deliberately.
#
# Cloudflare Pages honours only the LAST matching block for a given path. An
# earlier version of this file ended with a second /* block carrying nothing but
# Cache-Control, which silently discarded the entire security header set above it.
# Every deployed site still had the right text in the file and none of the headers
# on the wire. `npm run check:headers` asserts the live response, not this file.
#
# Nothing is cached for a year. `immutable` promises that a URL changes when its
# contents do, and this site has no build step and no content hashing, so a deploy
# that edits site.css ships the same /assets/site.css URL. Browsers and
# Cloudflare both take that promise literally, so the old file stays correct
# forever and no deploy can reach anyone who already loaded the site.
#
# That shipped: the utility site served a months-old scanner to returning
# visitors, whose button was dead and whose camera never opened, while ninety
# tests passed against the working tree. Revalidating is one conditional request
# per load and it is the only policy that makes deploying without a build step
# safe. The rule: max-age=0, must-revalidate on anything whose URL survives a
# deploy, and immutable only behind a content hash.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/brand/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/.well-known/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/llms.txt
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
